cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "verified-deflate: DEFLATE compression with LZ77 parsers proved correct in Lean"
abstract: >-
  gzip, zlib, raw DEFLATE and BGZF compression whose LZ77 parsers are proved correct in
  Lean 4: for every input, the tokens a parser emits decode back to that input. The
  parsers are submissions #521, #85 and #243 to the conjectures.io DEFLATE competition
  (September and October 2026), included unmodified with the proofs the competition's
  validator accepted.
authors:
  - name: "Dendrite Holdings"
    website: "https://dendrite.holdings"
  - name: "Conjectures.io"
    website: "https://conjectures.io"
version: "0.1.0"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/conjectures-io/conjectures-deflate"
url: "https://conjectures.io/competitions/deflate"
keywords:
  - compression
  - deflate
  - gzip
  - zlib
  - formal verification
  - lean
